  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The kinetic energy of an electron,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo></math>particle and a proton are given as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>K</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math> respectively. The de-Broglie wavelength associated with electron <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo></math>particle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and the proton <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></math> are as follows:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "vhdht",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></math>",
